A||||4||kslish||Going through Pittsburgh on your way to Carlisle?||||1||
Z||000000||kslish||05-17-2001||02:49 AM||||Hey all,<P>I'm wondering if anyone that is coming through Pittsburgh, PA on Friday on their way to Carlisle would be willing to hook up with me to caravan the rest of the way.  My local club isn't leaving for Carlisle until 5am Saturday morning to make the trip.  I've done this the past two years and I don't want to do it again (the fatigue takes some of the enjoyment away from the show as the day wears on).  I'd much rather prefer to get to Carlisle sometime Friday, check into the hotel, and kick back and relax with some fellow Fiero owners Friday night.  Also, I like to travel with at least another car in case of some unplanned mechanical failure (even though I have my trusty AAA card).  <P>Let me know!!!<P>Ken S.<BR>'87GT and '86SC<BR> <A HREF="http://www.westpennfiero.org" TARGET=_blank>www.westpennfiero.org</A> ||||reg||1
